 class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S\\)</span> (critical-point predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"327fc5339902933e\" href=\"?note=327fc5339902933e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md\">../batch01/58-df-critical-point.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> (pure-membership structure code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}rank\\text{-}into\\text{-}rank\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8RankIntoRankCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,j\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda)\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}rank\\text{-}into\\text{-}rank\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8RankIntoRankCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\exists\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,j\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda)\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the set-coded rank-into-rank pattern usually called an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I3\">\\(I3\\)</span>-type embedding.  The carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> is first packaged as its pure-membership structure, because both the elementary-embedding and critical-point predicates take structure codes rather than bare sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/